msgstr "Ihanda ang mga product state $\\mathrm{QFT}^\\dagger|x\\rangle$ na ginagamit ng sampled process-fidelity estimator sa Figure 2a ng Ref. [[1]](#references).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build equivalent unitary and dynamic implementations of quantum Fourier transform followed by measurement (QFT+M).\n"
msgstr "Bumuo ng katumbas na unitary at dynamic implementations ng quantum Fourier transform followed by measurement (QFT+M).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Select physical qubits for the dynamic circuits using current calibration and connectivity data.\n"
msgstr "Pumili ng physical qubit para sa mga dynamic circuit gamit ang kasalukuyang calibration at connectivity data.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
